{
  "info": {
    "name": "Emmott Asset Platform API - Complete Auth Flow",
    "description": "Complete authentication workflow including registration, login, forgot password, and reset password with automatic JWT token management. All emails are sent via Resend.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "version": "2.0.0"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "📋 Complete Authentication Flow",
      "description": "Follow these requests in order to test the complete authentication system",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1️⃣ Register New User",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"email\": \"john.doe@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"StrongPassword123!\",\n  \"role\": \"COMPANY_ADMIN\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "✅ **Step 1:** Register a new user account\n\n**What happens:**\n- User is created in database\n- Password is hashed with bcrypt\n- JWT token is returned automatically\n- Token is saved to environment variable"
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"jwt_token\", jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"user_email\", jsonData.user.email);",
                  "    console.log(\"✅ User registered! JWT Token saved:\", jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "    console.log(\"📧 Email saved:\", jsonData.user.email);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2️⃣ Login with Credentials",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{user_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"StrongPassword123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "✅ **Step 2:** Login with email and password\n\n**What happens:**\n- Credentials are validated\n- Password is verified with bcrypt\n- New JWT token is issued\n- Token is saved to environment"
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"jwt_token\", jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "    console.log(\"✅ Login successful! JWT Token saved:\", jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3️⃣ Request Password Reset",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{user_email}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "forgot-password"]
            },
            "description": "📧 **Step 3:** Request password reset\n\n**What happens:**\n- Random token (32 bytes) is generated\n- Token is saved to database with 1-hour expiration\n- Email sent via Resend with reset token\n- Check your email and copy the token!"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "4️⃣ Reset Password with Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_EMAIL_HERE\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"NewSecurePassword123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "reset-password"]
            },
            "description": "🔐 **Step 4:** Reset password using token from email\n\n**What happens:**\n- Token is validated (not expired, exists)\n- New password is hashed with bcrypt\n- Password is updated in database\n- Reset token is cleared\n- Confirmation email sent via Resend\n\n⚠️ **Important:** Paste the token from your email in the request body!"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "5️⃣ Login with New Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{user_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"NewSecurePassword123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "✅ **Step 5:** Verify new password works\n\n**What happens:**\n- Login with the new password\n- If successful, password was reset correctly!\n- JWT token is issued"
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"jwt_token\", jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "    console.log(\"✅ New password works! JWT Token saved:\", jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "👥 Protected User Endpoints",
      "description": "These endpoints require JWT authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create User (Admin Only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}",
                "description": "Auto-filled from environment"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Jane Smith\",\n  \"email\": \"jane.smith@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"SecurePass456!\",\n  \"role\": \"COMPANY_ADMIN\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users"]
            },
            "description": "🔒 **Protected:** Requires JWT + Admin role\n\nCreates a new user. Only accessible to SUPER_ADMIN or COMPANY_ADMIN."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Find User by Email",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}",
                "description": "Auto-filled from environment"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/by-email/{{user_email}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "by-email", "{{user_email}}"]
            },
            "description": "🔒 **Protected:** Requires JWT\n\nSearches for a user by their email address."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🏢 Companies Module",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Company",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"legalName\": \"Empresa Demo SpA\",\n  \"tradeName\": \"DemoCorp\",\n  \"email\": \"contacto@democorp.cl\",\n  \"phone\": \"+56912345678\",\n  \"website\": \"https://democorp.cl\",\n  \"billing\": {\n    \"rut\": \"76.123.456-7\",\n    \"companyType\": \"SpA\",\n    \"businessActivity\": \"Desarrollo de Software\",\n    \"fiscalAddress\": \"Av. Providencia 123\",\n    \"commune\": \"Providencia\",\n    \"region\": \"RM\",\n    \"legalRepName\": \"Juan Perez\",\n    \"legalRepRut\": \"10.000.000-1\",\n    \"legalRepPosition\": \"CEO\",\n    \"industry\": \"technology\",\n    \"companySize\": \"small\"\n  },\n  \"subscription\": {\n    \"plan\": \"professional\",\n    \"billingFrequency\": \"monthly\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/companies",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["companies"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new company with billing and subscription details (Super Admin only)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get All Companies",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/companies",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["companies"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "jwt_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "user_email",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ]
}
